<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Covance rated attractive.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Covance rated attractive.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Vector Securities International Inc said Friday it initiated coverage of Covance Inc, the recent spinoff from Corning Inc, with an attractive rating.</p>
<p>--Its earnings per share estimates for the contract research company are $0.69 for 1997 and $0.84 for 1998.</p>
<p>--Analyst John Kreger in a report said his 12-month price target on the stock is $25.</p>
<p>--Covance was unchanged at 20-1/2.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
